---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { VIDEO_BASE } from "../videoBase";

// Static page — generated at build time, not per request. Webflow Cloud
// requires output: "server". These pages were prerendered (`= true`); the
// Basic-auth gate in src/middleware.ts only runs for on-demand routes, so they
// are server-rendered instead. Flip back to `true` and delete the middleware to
// restore static generation.
export const prerender = false;
---

<Base title="Maritime — Saltenna" description="Saltenna is developing Plasmonix™ communications for maritime environments — between divers, uncrewed underwater and surface vehicles, and along the seabed — where wireless has never worked before" active="maritime">

  <section class="page-hero color-media sea-hero">
    <video class="bg-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="images/posters/maritime-hero.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
      <source src={`${VIDEO_BASE}/maritime-hero.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <div class="container hero-lead">
      <h1>Maritime Communications and Sensing</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-info">
      <div class="hero-info-tag">
        <p>Where wireless can't reach</p>
        <a class="hero-scroll" href="#challenge" aria-label="Scroll to content">&#8595;</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-info-desc">Saltenna's Plasmonix™ technology extends underwater, on the surface, and along the seabed — connecting divers, uncrewed vehicles, and vessels without needing line of sight</p>
      <nav class="hero-info-links" aria-label="Maritime use cases">
        <a href="#uc-uncrewed">UUV Swarming</a>
        <a href="#uc-oilgas">Oil &amp; Gas</a>
        <a href="#uc-divers">Divers</a>
        <a href="#uc-surface">USV</a>
        <a href="#uc-seabed">Seabed</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The problem the use cases answer -->
  <section class="block dark has-fx" id="challenge">
    <canvas class="fx-canvas" data-fx="field" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <h2>The ocean is a wireless dead zone</h2>
        <p>Wireless systems that thrive on land stop at the waterline. Saltenna's Plasmonix™ surface waves are being developed to work where the maritime domain defeats them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 12 Q5 8 8 12 T14 12 T20 12"/><path d="M2 17 Q5 13 8 17 T14 17 T20 17"/><path d="M5 20 L19 4"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Seawater Stops RF</h3>
          <p>Conventional radio is absorbed just below the surface, cutting off divers, vehicles, and sensors from the assets above them</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 12s3-6 9-6 9 6 9 6-3 6-9 6-9-6-9-6z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"/><path d="M4 20 L20 4"/></svg></div>
          <h3>No Line of Sight</h3>
          <p>Hulls, seawalls, islands, and the air-water boundary itself break the direct paths that optical and acoustic links depend on</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 9a9 9 0 0 1 14 0"/><path d="M7.5 12a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9 0"/><path d="M13 14l-2.5 4h3.5l-2.5 4"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Contested Spectrum</h3>
          <p>Above the surface, jamming and interference can deny conventional RF exactly when the link matters most</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block deep has-fx" id="use-cases">
    <canvas class="fx-canvas" data-fx="field" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <h2>Communications across the maritime domain</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="split use-case-panel reveal" id="uc-uncrewed">
        <div>
          <h3>UUV Communications and Swarming</h3>
          <p>Saltenna is developing communications between uncrewed underwater vehicles (UUVs) at range, enabling swarming behavior underwater. This extends to communications between UUVs and UAVs, bridging the air-water barrier.</p>
          <!-- placeholder route until a detail page exists -->
          <p><a class="post-more" href="#">Learn More</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-media video-media" data-parallax="0.22">
          <video class="lazy-video" data-speed="1.3" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="images/posters/maritime-uuv-swarming.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
            <source src={`${VIDEO_BASE}/maritime-uuv-swarming.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <span class="video-replay-hint" aria-hidden="true">&#8634; replay</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split reverse use-case-panel reveal" id="uc-oilgas">
        <div>
          <h3>Oil &amp; Gas Communications</h3>
          <p>Saltenna is working on wireless communications along and through subsea energy infrastructure — risers, pipelines, and platforms, including those filled with hazardous liquids — supporting offshore inspection and monitoring</p>
          <!-- placeholder route until a detail page exists -->
          <p><a class="post-more" href="#">Learn More</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-media video-media" data-parallax="0.22">
          <video class="lazy-video" data-speed="1.3" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="images/posters/maritime-oil-gas.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
            <source src={`${VIDEO_BASE}/maritime-oil-gas.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <span class="video-replay-hint" aria-hidden="true">&#8634; replay</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split use-case-panel reveal" id="uc-divers">
        <div>
          <h3>Diver-to-Diver Communications</h3>
          <p>Saltenna is developing underwater communications between dive teams at significant range, including through solid obstacles such as seawalls or the hull of a passing vessel</p>
          <!-- placeholder route until a detail page exists -->
          <p><a class="post-more" href="#">Learn More</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-media video-media" data-parallax="0.22">
          <video class="lazy-video" data-speed="1.3" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="images/posters/maritime-diver-to-diver.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
            <source src={`${VIDEO_BASE}/maritime-diver-to-diver.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <span class="video-replay-hint" aria-hidden="true">&#8634; replay</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split reverse use-case-panel reveal" id="uc-surface">
        <div>
          <h3>USV / Surface Vessel Communications</h3>
          <p>Saltenna is developing communications between uncrewed surface vessels (USVs) at range, engineered to withstand jamming</p>
          <p><a class="post-more" href="https://claude.ai/artifacts/latest/67483ee6-5bfa-4253-a1cc-fe47173d1eb8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn More</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-media video-media" data-parallax="0.22">
          <video class="lazy-video" data-speed="1.3" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="images/posters/maritime-usv-comms.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
            <source src={`${VIDEO_BASE}/maritime-usv-comms.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <span class="video-replay-hint" aria-hidden="true">&#8634; replay</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split use-case-panel reveal" id="uc-seabed">
        <div>
          <h3>Seabed Communications</h3>
          <p>Saltenna is developing communications along the seabed between UUVs, including through obstacles such as vertical pipes near the seabed — supporting infrastructure inspection and monitoring applications</p>
          <!-- placeholder route until a detail page exists -->
          <p><a class="post-more" href="#">Learn More</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-media video-media" data-parallax="0.22">
          <video class="lazy-video" data-speed="1.3" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="images/posters/maritime-seabed.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
            <source src={`${VIDEO_BASE}/maritime-seabed.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <span class="video-replay-hint" aria-hidden="true">&#8634; replay</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="image-band">
    <video class="lazy-video" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="images/posters/band-seabed-divers.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
      <source src={`${VIDEO_BASE}/band-seabed-divers.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <div class="container reveal">
      <h2>Along the seabed</h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band has-fx">
    <canvas class="fx-canvas" data-fx="field" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="container reveal">
      <h2>Saltenna is evolving fast</h2>
      <p>We are developing seemingly impossible communications and sensing at the edge in the most demanding environments. Contact us to explore and craft powerful unique solutions.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="contact.html">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
